---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact CarComparisonAI: questions, data corrections and partnership inquiries."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
    <section class="py-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Contact us</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        For questions, data corrections, comparison requests or partnership inquiries, email us
        at{" "}
        <a
          href="mailto:info@carcomparisonai.com"
          class="text-brand underline hover:text-brand-dark"
        >
          info@carcomparisonai.com
        </a>
        . We read everything and usually reply within a couple of business days.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        If you're reporting a data error, please include the page link and the figure you
        believe is wrong - it helps us fix it faster.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Report a data correction</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Please send the vehicle year, make, model and trim, the value that appears incorrect,
        and a link to the EPA, NHTSA or manufacturer source that supports the correction. We
        check source data first, then update the affected comparisons and refresh date together.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">
        <li>Page URL and the exact table row or paragraph</li>
        <li>Correct value and model year</li>
        <li>Public source link or document title</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Suggest a comparison</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Tell us which two vehicles you are choosing between and what decision the page should
        help answer—for example family cargo, a long commute, home charging or purchase budget.
        Suggestions with a clear buyer use case are prioritized over broad requests to add an
        entire brand lineup.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Before reporting an estimate, review our
        <a href="/methodology" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:text-brand-dark">methodology</a>
        to see which values are official data and which are modeled assumptions.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
